WEBVTT

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:11.870
Everyone.

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:17.580
I know everyone here worked hard
for today's performance.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.540
Kotono.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:19.830
Yes.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:20.790
Sakura.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:21.950
Yes.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:22.990
Rei.

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:23.990
Yes.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.080
Nagisa.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.290
Yes.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.410
Suzu.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:28.950
Yes, indeed.

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:29.870
Saki.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.080
Yes.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:31.990
Chisa.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.580
Y-Yes.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:34.830
Shizuku.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:35.990
Yeah.

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:37.080
Miss Haruko.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.370
Yes.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.410
Mei.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:41.330
Yup!

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:45.240
To be honest, technique-wise,
we're far from perfect.

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:50.200
But all your efforts up until today
are engraved in you.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.450
Give it everything you've got
now for this performance!

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:55.620
Yes!

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.870
Ready Kotono?

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:04.080
Yeah.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.790
Hoshimi Productions!

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:12.090
Let's...

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:12.740
...go!

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:13.870
Fight!

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:17.330
Go, go, go! Yeah!

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:28.200
This stage is our very first step.

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:31.370
Are you watching...

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:32.790
...Mana?

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.040
5 YEARS AGO

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.040
Hoshimi High School

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.540
"Congratulations           "Welcome         "Spring
 on your admission!"    New Students!"    Festival"

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:48.490
Hey, new students!

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:53.740
Promise me you'll make the next three years
an unforgettable high school experience!

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:01.200
The light and shadow of youth.

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:02.740
Next, each club will be coming up
to promote themselves!

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.870
Of course, she's the light and I'm...

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:04.870
Make sure to stay for it
if you're still undecided.

00:02:04.870 --> 00:02:07.450
Makino, hurry up!

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:08.200
But I'd recommend staying for it
even if you've decided, too!

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:08.200
Coming!

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:11.740
They go all out for these presentations,
so please check them out!

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:15.200
After that, we'll move on to
the fun recreational activities!

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:23.410
Light and shadow don't mix inherently...

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:31.620
Why is she sitting next to me?

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:32.740
It's science next.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:35.120
I'm so going to fall asleep!

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.450
After class?

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:37.540
Yup.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:40.370
I want to talk to you about something.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.370
It can't be now?

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.120
No!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.910
Listen.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:55.410
I better see you after school!

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.240
What was that about?

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.080
The emperor has abdicated

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.660
and by next autumn,

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.660
As far as these things go...

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.660
he shaved his head
and entered priesthood.

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:12.740
It's usually a confession...

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:12.740
He wandered the mountains
here and there

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.700
No... There's no way that would happen to me.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.700
and devoted himself
to Buddhist training.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.790
The narrator speaks in a distinct tone
regarding the emperor.

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:18.790
It must be one of those pranks or something.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.950
They have great respect
towards the emperor.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:21.950
Do people still do those things?

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:23.540
This will be on the test.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.410
I guess so...

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.200
A prank?

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:33.410
What is?

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:35.910
What do you mean? Um...

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:36.990
This scenario...

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:39.410
I'm not sure what you're talking about.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:45.660
Anyway, I have a favor to ask you, Makino.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.700
An idol...?

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:51.870
Yeah...

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.370
Is that weird?

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:55.410
No.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.580
I was just surprised because it was abrupt.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:01.990
But well, I'd say you can become one.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:04.950
Nagase, you can be an idol.

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.990
I think it would suit you, Nagase.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:08.200
It's Mana!

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.580
What?

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.200
Just call me Mana.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.200
Everyone else calls me that, too.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.080
What... Um...

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.450
That's a bit...

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:19.160
It's totally fine!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.160
All right...

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.580
Then...

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:27.830
Mana.

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.080
Good!

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.120
Then, Makino...

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:36.040
Oh, my first name is Kohei.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.580
I knew that.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.330
You can call me Kohei, too.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:41.160
No, that would be weird.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:43.620
I'm calling you Makino, okay?

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:45.830
If we call each other by our
first names out of the blue,

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.830
everyone would get suspicious.

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.700
That doesn't make any sense.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:51.830
So...

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:57.790
It seems like the person who
scouted me is a famous producer.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:59.080
Nagas--

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.870
That probably happens to you a lot, Mana.

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:04.870
That's not true.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:09.410
It's never happened to me before,
so I don't know what to do.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.830
But I am interested...

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:15.950
So I thought about it a lot
and consulted my little sister...

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:18.240
So, why me...?

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:20.330
W-Well.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:24.660
Boys can be knowledgeable about idols, right?

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:28.490
It's not like all the guys are...

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:32.410
There's that complicated
Venus-something system, right?

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:36.580
I thought I'd consult someone
knowledgeable about that.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.790
I'm not knowledgeable at all, either.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:42.450
I would ask Furuta or Kawano about that--

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.700
I'm asking you, Makino!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:52.080
I haven't told anyone else about this,

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.660
so don't tell anyone, okay?

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:56.790
I don't get it... Why me?

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.830
That's because...

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:06.700
You sit right next to me and it was convenient!

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.950
Purely proximity, huh?

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:17.290
So... About that favor I wanted to ask...

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.580
Yeah.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:20.790
Actually...

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.700
Hoshimi Productions

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.700
Hoshimi Productions

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.700
Hoshimi Productions

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.700
Hoshimi Productions

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.700
Hoshimi Productions

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.700
Hoshimi Productions

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:31.790
Kohei Makino, a second-year in high school.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:33.790
So you're classmates with Mana?

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:35.160
Yes.

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.990
What's your relationship?

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.410
Well...

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.700
We sit right next to each other.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:42.330
Sit next to each other?

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:43.660
That's it?

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:44.990
Naga--

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:48.660
Mana and I've never really spoken at school...

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.700
That's not true!

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.580
We've spoken three times...

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.490
Or was it twice...?

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.790
Are you familiar with the Venus Program?

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.370
Yes, the general idea of it.

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:05.580
It's a ranking system for idols, right?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:06.540
That's right.

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:12.040
Based on various data like popularity,
performance, and audience reaction,

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:16.120
an AI makes a judgment and
spits out the numeric data.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.790
An AI...?

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:21.700
It's an attempt to have idols
compete under equal conditions.

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.240
It's sounding more like a sports game.

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:28.660
We'll be registering idols from our
agency in the Venus Program, too.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.490
Mana, too, of course.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:35.410
It's true that we're short-handed.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:38.660
We'll have to hire someone eventually
to keep things running.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:42.120
Since you're in school, you'll be
part-time until you graduate.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.620
What? So that means...

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:46.290
You're hired.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:48.950
Thank you very much, President.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:52.370
That's too stuffy, just call me Saegusa.

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:57.620
To hire you part-time was one of the conditions
to get Mana to sign with us, anyway.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.700
--Hey!
--What?

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.580
We had already decided to hire you.

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:05.160
Mr. Saegusa, you promised you wouldn't tell!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.330
Oh, yeah?

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:07.790
Gosh!

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.790
Mana, I'm coming in.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.040
Okay!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.080
It's almost time for rehears--

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.200
What do you think?

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:30.660
It's... all right.

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.580
Look at me and say it.

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:33.990
I am looking.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:36.790
How would you rate me out of 100?

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.490
Eighty-five...

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:42.950
Apparently, not being able to say 100
is the nature of Japanese people.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:47.330
If I rated you 100 already,
what happens when you improve?

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.450
I, Mana Nagase,

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:53.200
will aim to be an idol that can't
be rated on a 100-point-scale!

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.540
Miss Nagase, it's time for rehearsal!

00:08:58.540 --> 00:08:59.950
Coming!

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.790
"Newcomer Award"

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.870
"Idol Championship"

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.870
Pretty soon, I'll be a high school graduate.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.830
Time flew by quick!

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:11.950
Oh, yeah!

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:13.830
Let's go for a drive soon!

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:16.490
Hey! Don't talk to me right now.

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:17.830
I just got my driver's license...

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:19.950
Here, say, "ah."

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:29.910
We're gonna be even busier after we graduate.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.040
So you better brace yourself!

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:34.490
You better not forget you said that.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.450
Graduate representative, Mana Nagase.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.450
Graduation

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:42.740
Yes!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:48.330
During my six years attending
Hoshimi Junior High and High School,

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:51.080
I've had various encounters.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:56.700
Each encounter contributed to who I am today
and led to my current entertainment career.

00:10:56.700 --> 00:11:00.990
I am grateful for the open-minded
teachers at this school...

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:01.990
Senpai!

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:03.950
Congratulations on graduating!

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.790
Are you staying for the concert?

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:09.790
"Mana Nagase Special Concert Stage"

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:07.290
Of course!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:09.790
It's a privilege as a
Hoshimi High School student.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:12.740
Happy graduation, Makino.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:14.790
Congratulations, Mana.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:19.410
Well, I better go!

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:24.330
Make sure you watch my last
concert as a high school student!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.580
I will.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.410
Wow!

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:48.080
After graduating high school,
I was promoted from a part-time

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:50.830
to a full-time employee at Hoshimi Productions.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.400
Reception Room

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:58.370
The 14th Next Venus Grand Prix.

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:01.290
Will we be entering it this time?

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:04.040
I'll leave that decision to both of you.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.830
Why didn't we enter it last year?

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:09.490
I deemed it was too early.

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:13.240
The Venus Grand Prix is
limited to newcomer idols only.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:17.700
If I win, I instantly join
the ranks of top idols.

