00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.830
Your current popularity doesn't apply.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:25.080
Every participant starts off
from an equal baseline.

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:27.660
It will test your true abilities.

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:29.240
Um, I think I'll--

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:29.770
I'll enter!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.450
What?

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:32.700
Let's do this!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:34.950
You are my senior, Haruko!

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:36.200
It's our chance!

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:38.580
Only by two months...

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:41.870
Well, if you are entering...

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:44.660
I'll make sure I win, of course!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:47.700
Haruko and I will both participate!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.700
What?! What?!

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.410
M-Mana...

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:52.910
Let's do this together!

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.120
--All right!
--Oh, no...

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:01.160
I'm so nervous.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:16.620
Do you have the confidence
to defeat all these rivals?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:18.830
Who do you think I am?

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.620
Jeez.

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:23.200
You haven't changed at all, huh?

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:24.830
I can't afford to lose at this point.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:27.790
I want to meet everyone's expectations.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:30.620
For Haruko, who unfortunately lost...

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.870
For Mr. Saegusa and the staff...

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:37.200
And most importantly,
for my fans who support me.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.160
You're right.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:41.740
And plus a little for you, too, Makino.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:43.490
I'm just an after-thought, huh?

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.990
This is as far as I go every time.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:55.580
I can only watch you from here.

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:58.160
That's your job right, Makino?

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:03.660
Yeah.

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.410
Plus...

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.490
You being there...

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.580
...could be a source of power for me.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:12.160
Here I go!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.540
"Mana Nagase"

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:21.660
She did it!

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.620
Go, Mana!

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:47.450
"Mana Nagase"

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:09.240
It's the monumental final round.

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:12.450
I wanted you to take me there, Makino.

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.580
The traffic seems to be bad right now.

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:17.240
You better be there for my performance!

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.580
I'll head over as soon as I finish this errand.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.660
All right, then.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:25.620
I won't forgive you for being late,
even if you apologize.

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:26.540
Mana.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.790
You made it to the final round.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:33.160
You really are amazing.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.540
Doing what I said I would is my policy.

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.830
Have I ever said any lies?

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.790
Lots of them.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.240
Did I really?

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:50.290
You better be there no matter what, Makino.

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.790
If you're not there...

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:02.120
I'll be waiting for you.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.910
Sorry for the wait.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:20.950
It's true that she said a bunch of little lies.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:25.330
But she never told a big lie.

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:28.450
Mana declared that she'd win.

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:32.040
Because she did, she really would.

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.120
That's how it felt.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:34.790
Excuse me!

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:39.450
Are you from Hoshimi Productions?

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:41.330
Yes, I am.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.200
Still nothing?

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:45.080
Come on.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.330
They're taking too long.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.660
It could be part of the performance.

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:55.080
"Hoshimi General Hospital"

