00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:18.370
Mana's accidental death became the biggest news
of the year when it reached the press.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:19.540
And so...

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:25.160
The final round of the 14th
Next Venus Grand Prix

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.410
never commenced.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:32.080
2 YEARS AGO

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:38.620
Makino?

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.410
Makino.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.660
Oh, yes?

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.740
Is that your phone?

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:48.080
Yes, thank you for your call.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.160
Yes, yes.

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:29.240
Being in the industry can make you
develop weird habits.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:36.450
The day of the accident, I thought in the back
of my mind I was being involved in a prank.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:40.620
The day of the final round...
She was sent off by herself...

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:42.410
The conditions were perfect.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.330
Nothing's changed.

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:54.040
The instigator is Mana herself.

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:58.910
She'll come out laughing at
my dumbfounded face.

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:02.450
I would've been really mad.

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:03.910
But...

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:05.950
Even then...

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.990
That would've been...

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:09.660
...a lot more...

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.240
Makino.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:23.200
No way.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.740
Makino, over here.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.120
Did I surprise you?

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:36.240
Mana...

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:44.790
Hey... So, it was a prank.

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:48.950
Suspicious as always, I see.

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:53.040
We've known each other so long,
let's have a little more trust.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:57.200
Then stop doing things to startle me.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:58.870
You're right.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:19:59.990
Sorry!

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:04.410
That day, I met Mana again.

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:06.740
This time, as a ghost.

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:12.620
TODAY

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:16.950
Morning!

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:19.120
Well, don't you seem fired up?

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:20.950
Of course I am.

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.660
Interview day, was it?

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.370
What is it?

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:30.160
You look more like an interviewee
than an interviewer.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.660
Well, excuse me.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:34.540
But I'm three years older now,

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.080
unlike you.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:38.370
Ghosts don't age!

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:40.830
You can still grow mentally.

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:43.160
I've been growing, thank you very much.

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:46.120
I'm a ghost, so let me take my time.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:49.870
I feel like you're becoming more
and more of a slacker.

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:53.450
You used to shine brightly back in the day.

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:56.990
You know that's a taboo thing
to say to a popular idol!

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:59.910
That was when you were alive, right?

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.790
Were you doing interviews today?

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:07.790
Yes.

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:10.450
There may be a great increase in junior idols.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.540
I'm happy to hear that.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.080
Thank you very much.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:18.200
But it gets me thinking of
my future career, too.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:21.370
I'm sorry that I've been so useless...

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:22.870
That's not what I meant.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:26.120
That's right. It's all your fault, Makino.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:29.120
You're failing to bring out Haruko's charms.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:30.330
I agree...

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:31.160
Huh?

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:33.990
I'm sorry, I was talking to myself!

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:35.700
Dummy.

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:38.830
I wonder what kind of girls we'll see today.

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.870
I'm looking forward to it.

